        "collapsible_tab_WE8egq": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Description",
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<p><strong>Dive Slate Pro: Your Underwater Notebook for Every Adventure</strong></p><p>The <strong>Dive Slate Pro</strong> is the ultimate tool for divers who need to communicate, record, and explore with precision. Whether you're identifying fish, jotting down navigation points, or documenting search and recovery operations, this slate keeps your notes secure and accessible in any environment.</p><p>Designed for practicality and ease of use, the <strong>Dive Slate Pro</strong> comes with a quick-attach carabiner and a quick-release buckle, making it effortless to clip to your BCD and detach when needed. Its lightweight, durable white surface provides ample writing space on both sides, ensuring you’ll never run out of room for your thoughts or observations. The included pencil is securely tethered with an elastic tube, so it’s always within reach when you need it most.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_YFRtGK": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Features",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "content": "<h5><strong>Dual-Sided Writing Surface</strong>: Write, draw, or record notes on both sides of the slate—plenty of space for all your underwater needs.</h5><h5><strong>Quick-Attach System</strong>: Carabiner and quick-release buckle make attachment and removal seamless, even with gloves on.</h5><h5><strong>Tethered Pencil</strong>: The elastic tube keeps the pencil securely attached, so you can focus on your dive without worrying about losing your tools.: Measuring approx. 20 x 14.6 x 2mm, it’s the ideal size for any dive.</h5><h5><strong>Dive Slate Pro</strong> is an indispensable part of your underwater gear. Dive smarter, communicate clearly, and explore confidently with this essential tool by your side.</h5>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
